{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-bay-villas","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"bay-villas","about":"Immerse yourself in serenity at Bay Villas Dubai Islands by Nakheel, where opulent homes blend seamlessly with the tranquil charm of island living. Set on Island B, this low-density waterfront community offers a refined balance between coastal privacy and easy access to the city.Prospective buyers can select from 3 to 4-bedroom townhouses, 3 to 4-bedroom semi-detached villas, 4 to 5-bedroom garden villas, and exclusive 5 to 6-bedroom beachfront and waterfront villas. Each residence at Bay Villas is meticulously designed, featuring expansive interiors, premium finishes, and thoughtfully selected fittings inspired by a “barefoot luxury” aesthetic.Revel in an abundance of lifestyle-focused amenities at Bay Villas Nakheel, crafted for a resort-style experience. Residents enjoy private beach access, beach club, linear parks, shoreline park, clubhouse with pool, fitness areas, sports courts, play areas, seating pavilions, and barbecue zones, completing the ultimate fusion of luxury, nature, and relaxed island living.","price":4000000,"title":"Bay Villas","bitrix":{"id":351,"pf_id":"are.3.13563","source":null,"project_id":"Dubai Islands","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Bay Villas","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Nakheel","project_location":"Deira"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/bay_villas_feature_72bf78fd66.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/bay_villas_feature_72bf78fd66.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.335167,"lng":55.303498},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/bay_villas_1_e0167b91cd.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/bay_villas_1_e0167b91cd.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/